WEBVTT

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:37.110
Florence at the beginning of the 16th century--

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:39.530
The city bustled during Carnival,

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:44.650
and people had fun with abandon
in the clever costumes they prepared.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.030
E-Excuse me.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:53.320
It's fine.

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:56.980
Wow...

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:00.150
Oh dear, I do apologize.

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:01.570
It's okay.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:08.280
Oh! What am I doing?
I'm in the middle of an errand.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:15.190
Carnival isn't really an event
that has anything to do with me.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:20.650
Arte, I'll take you somewhere interesting today.

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:21.900
Okay!

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.030
Put this on and get ready.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.360
What's the matter? You don't want to go?

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:38.190
No, that's not it...
I was just a little surprised.

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:40.360
I'll get ready right away.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:18.550
"First Job"

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:18.530
I can't believe Leo is taking me somewhere!
And during Carnival, too!

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:21.530
I wonder where we're going...

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:25.610
A party somewhere... or a banquet?

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:31.110
But why do I have to change-- Hm?

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.030
Finally done changing, huh?

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.530
Let's go.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:49.480
U-Um, wait a minute.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.480
Aren't these boys' clothes?

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:55.650
Yeah, it's fine. You don't look
like anything other than a boy.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:56.940
Huh?

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.650
Make sure you keep your hair under the hat.

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:09.190
Where in the world are we going?

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:12.070
He's not paying attention to
the Carnival festivities at all.

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:16.320
Anyway, what places are there that won't
let me in unless I'm dressed as a boy...?

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:24.690
At any rate, Leo walks too fast!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:28.730
Watch where you're going, boy!

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.690
I-I'm sorry!

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:33.150
B-Boy...?

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.610
L-Leo?!

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:44.150
Oh, there he is!

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:46.070
Leo!

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:56.570
No, no, that's not true.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:02.230
Oh, and who's this?

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:05.110
What a cute boy.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:08.980
My apprentice. Started at
my workshop six months ago.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:15.900
Oh, Leo, you have an apprentice?
I thought you were either an ogre or a demon.

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:19.900
With this, do you understand
that I was also born human?

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:22.440
Leo's smiling?

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:27.650
When he's talking to me, he always
acts like either an ogre or a demon...

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:30.780
Why are you scowling?

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:40.230
I'm sure it's hard to apprentice under
this man, but please do you best, boy.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.110
Well, see you later, Leo.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.030
A sweet... scent...

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:49.900
Who was that?

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:52.780
A regular customer of mine. A patron.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:56.360
A patron? Is she a noble?

00:05:56.360 --> 00:06:00.030
She's a courtesan. A high-class prostitute.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:02.530
It's my first time seeing one.

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:04.230
I'll bet.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:08.150
You two looked like you were having fun.
What were you talking about?

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.690
Not much.

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:14.530
It was the first time I saw that smile.

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:18.070
I didn't know he could smile like that...

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:19.190
Let's go!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.860
Oh, coming!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:26.110
Here we are.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.280
Huh?

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:32.150
This is a hospital, you know.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:33.570
Just be quiet and follow me.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:36.230
Can we just walk in like this?

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.690
They're doing it, they're doing it.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:40.480
Huh?

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.190
Huh? Wait a min--

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:51.230
Leo! Leo... wait up.

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:55.570
Please don't go off first on your own.

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:57.030
We'll get separated.

00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:59.230
You have a good view from here, right?

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:07.280
This is... a dissection?!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.280
Don't talk too loudly.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:17.730
At the time, dissections were
prohibited by the church.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:21.900
But during Carnival, everything was permitted,

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:26.070
so many aimed to perform
dissections during that period.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.820
Here, take this.

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:31.820
Tools for sketching?

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:36.230
In order to paint human bodies,
you need to know their structure.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:42.980
It's too risky for a small workshop like ours
to pay for a dissection ourselves.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.480
So make good use of this chance.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:50.230
I see. That's why you had me
dress as a boy and come here.

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.030
Hey, someone fainted!

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.650
Carry him out!

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:06.280
Maybe it was too intense for the youngster.

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:08.860
Arte, are you all right?

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:13.530
Is something the matter, Leo?

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:15.900
No, it's nothing.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:20.650
Leo, you were right. This place <i>is</i> interesting.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.900
She's got some guts.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.190
I can't see...

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.610
H-Hey!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.480
--A scream?
--Hey.

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.360
Don't tell me...

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:44.980
--A girl! A girl!
--There's a girl in here!
--Who brought a girl in here?

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:47.190
Um, this is--

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:50.230
Leo!

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:51.610
We're running away!

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:53.230
Hey, don't let them get away!

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.940
If the church found out we let a girl in,
we'd get in serious trouble!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.070
Did we lose them?

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:09.730
It looks like it...

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:13.940
Um, Leo, I'm sure I'm heavy,
so you can put me down now...

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:17.150
Put me down... Please, put me down!

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:18.650
Right.

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:22.610
Are you all right?

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:24.610
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.150
I got flustered...

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:28.150
Did you see them?

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.650
What about over there?

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:33.980
Damn it, where'd they go?

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.820
Stay calm. Stay calm.

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:49.030
If I panic like I did earlier,
then they'll find us...

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:51.230
Ah, so close!

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:59.530
This is my first time seeing a man's face
so close that's not a painting or sculpture.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:04.940
The skin looks so tough...
The bone structure's rugged...

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:07.360
And there's the facial hair and Adam's apple...

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:11.230
Their bodies are made completely
differently from ours...

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:13.940
It's like they're a different kind of animal.

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.820
This is really great reference!

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:21.570
I think it should be fine now.

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:32.440
Well, shall we go back to the workshop?

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.980
Hey, hey, what's the matter?

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:41.110
For some reason... my chest
suddenly started hurting...

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.190
Do you need to go to the hospital?

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:47.320
Maybe I should go...

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.150
What <i>is</i> this?

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:52.570
I don't like it. It hurts a lot!

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:08.280
Oof.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:44.400
Right now, my chest doesn't hurt.
I wonder what that was...

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:49.400
For some reason... my chest
suddenly started hurting...

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.150
Do you need to go to the hospital?

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:53.900
Maybe I should go...

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.690
What <i>is</i> this?

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:59.230
I don't like it. It hurts a lot!

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.400
That was...

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:09.030
Hey!

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:11.820
Don't fall asleep in front
of the fire. It's dangerous.

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:14.070
I-I'm sorry, Leo.

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:16.360
Also, come with me.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:23.360
Huh? Wh-What did you just say?

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:29.440
I said, you draw part of
the background for this.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.530
"From trainee to journeyman"

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:34.110
I-I-I-In...

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.310
"From trainee to journeyman"

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:37.070
In one bound!

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.400
Is it really all right?

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.730
I've only been training for six months.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:45.570
Doesn't it usually take about three years
before we're finally allowed to help?

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.650
Yeah, that's how it is.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:52.690
You already studied art and knew
the basics before coming here.

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:56.360
Having you start from the beginning
would be a waste of time.

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:59.280
Besides, you're pretty old.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.800
"Shocked"

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:08.650
Well, usually people start as apprentices
when they're around 13...

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:13.730
Listen, what I'd like you to do is a background
that fits this picture of a woman.

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.730
First, start with a sketch.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:21.030
Draw it on a separate sheet
of paper and show it to me.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:26.400
If you understand, then hurry up and start.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.860
Yes, sir!

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:37.650
This is my first time drawing for work.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:41.230
The assignment is a landscape
from the Arno River.

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:50.070
I-I'm happy, so I can't feel the cold, right?

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.030
I'm done!

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:12.070
Yeah, yeah, it looks good!
It was worth persevering through the cold.

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:16.190
I'm pretty sure we've got some time
before we need to deliver the painting.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:22.400
After I show Leo my sketch, I guess
I'll be painting on the wood panel next.

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:26.230
At this rate, we'll be able to finish
much earlier than the deadline.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:28.400
This is great!

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:32.070
All right, I'll keep working hard like this!

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:34.780
Do it over.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:36.190
Huh?

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:39.530
Hm? What's with that reaction?

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:42.570
Did you think you'd get it right
on the first try?

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:45.530
No, no, of course not.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:48.650
You want me to do it over, right?
I'll do it right away.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.150
I shouldn't be surprised.

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:55.650
It's for work, so there's
no way it'd be so easy.

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:58.570
All right, I'll do my best!

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.980
Do it over.

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:10.070
No good.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:14.110
It's no good. Do it again.

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:27.190
I can't get him to approve it at all...

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.570
What should I do?

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:34.030
I don't know how I should draw this anymore...

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:41.730
While I've been dawdling,

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:45.570
everything else in the painting
has almost been completed.

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:51.530
If I don't finish my part,
it won't be completed.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:54.650
There isn't much time left
before we have to deliver it.

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.610
To be so bad at it...

00:15:56.610 --> 00:16:01.190
Even though I'm a journeyman,
I'm just getting in Leo's way.

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:06.150
I have to work harder!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.320
Do it over.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:27.900
What's wrong?

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:30.980
Huh? Oh, um, it's nothing...

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:34.070
I see. Then hurry up and get back to work.

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:35.440
Yes, sir.

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:43.980
U-Um, Leo...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:51.070
I don't know how I should draw this anymore...
And at this rate, we won't make the deadline.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:54.230
I will cause trouble for you.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:17:00.780
Arte. What's the most
important thing in this picture?

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.230
Huh?

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:10.730
The most important thing...?

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:15.320
What kind of painting does the client want?

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:28.070
U-Um, I'm going to draw it again!

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:43.360
I didn't think about anything except
the background I was supposed to draw.

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:49.780
Even though the client wanted
a painting of the woman,

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:53.030
I made the background too prominent.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:57.730
What I should think about
is what the client wants.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.440
Okay, this works.

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:24.940
You can start work on painting this
directly onto the wood panel now.

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:27.900
I-- I... am not done yet!

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:28.780
Hm?

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:33.570
This is no time to rejoice.
The real thing starts now.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.730
Yes, I will do my best.

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:37.650
R-Right...

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:52.280
After that, I still struggled a lot,

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:56.400
but somehow, I was able to finish
painting by the delivery date.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:02.230
And the panel painting that was my first job...

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:05.360
...finally made it into the hands of the client.

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.360
Leo!

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:40.530
It's pretty dark. You've been
sketching in this room?

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:44.230
I only have one candle left.

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:45.690
Um, did you need something?

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:49.610
Now that work has calmed down
a bit, I thought we should go

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.860
to the notary to renew the contract.

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:58.940
Here's what's in the new contract.
Make sure you read it over.

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:04.940
Your annual contract fee
has also gone up a little.

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:11.440
I'll buy more candles with the extra money!

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:15.280
Then I can draw a lot after I finish work, too!

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:17.940
That's fine, but don't go overboard.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:22.190
You won't be able to do much
if a fire breaks out. Also...

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:31.690
You thought of yourself as being
in the way, didn't you?

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:33.440
Huh?!

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.820
He saw through me...

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:38.530
Don't think about unnecessary things.

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:44.780
You don't think about anything
and only look forward...

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:44.800
"Stab"

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:47.320
...and you're honest to a fault.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:47.350
"Stab"

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:49.110
That's all you have going for you.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:49.640
"Stab"

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:52.650
What's wrong?

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:56.610
Nothing... the words just hurt a little...

00:20:56.610 --> 00:21:00.940
Well, it's true, anyway.
There's nothing I can say to that.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:04.320
That <i>is</i> all I have...

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:08.650
I was often scolded by Mother
for doing nothing but drawing.

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:13.480
All I did was draw, and I never polished
any of my womanly charms.

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:15.820
Hm? Really?

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:18.150
I don't think that's true.

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:19.440
Huh?

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:25.940
I think a woman like you is much more charming

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:30.940
than those dolls that just do
what men say with dead eyes.

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:37.320
Sorry to interrupt. Don't stay up too late.

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:48.610
If she keeps facing forward
and standing with dignity,

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:53.320
then I won't be the only man
who recognizes her charms.

00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:06.980
Huh? What?

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:09.230
What...?

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:11.230
Ow...

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:15.780
Huh...?

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:18.780
Am I sick?

00:23:56.070 --> 00:23:59.440
"Preview"

00:23:56.530 --> 00:24:00.570
Why does Leo smile when he's with Veronica?

00:24:00.570 --> 00:24:02.480
Do your best, boy.

00:24:02.480 --> 00:24:05.570
I'm not a boy, but I'll do my best!

00:24:04.780 --> 00:24:11.050
"Courtesan"

00:24:05.570 --> 00:24:07.860
Next time, "Courtesan."

00:24:07.860 --> 00:24:10.030
There are many different ways of life!
